@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = {{signin.response.body.$.token}}

### Liveness: o processo esta de pe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness: o banco responde
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### Metricas no formato do Prometheus
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Preflight de CORS de uma origem autorizada
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: PUT

### Origem nao autorizada: sem Access-Control-Allow-Origin na resposta
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Origin: http://evil.example
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar uma conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carla",
  "email": "carla@example.com",
  "password": "senha-de-desenvolvimento"
}

### Cadastrar o mesmo e-mail de novo
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carla",
  "email": "carla@example.com",
  "password": "senha-de-desenvolvimento"
}

### Senha curta demais
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Curta",
  "email": "curta@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login — guarda o token para as proximas requisicoes
# @name signin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "senha-de-desenvolvimento"
}

### Senha errada: mesma mensagem de e-mail inexistente
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}

### Quem sou eu
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar as minhas tarefas
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sem token
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Token adulterado
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer nao.e.um.token

### Criar uma tarefa minha
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Proteger a API",
  "priority": "high"
}

### Tarefa de outra pessoa: 404, nao 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Estourar o limite do login (repita seis vezes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}
